js, React, SvelteKit, Astr…\n- new: Start a new project from scratch using the Software Factory process.\n- train: Extract lessons from the current session and update the memory brain.\n- launch-check: Pre-launch readiness gate for a built product. Run before going live.\n- verdict-30d: 30-day post-launch decision: SCALE, PIVOT, or KILL. No middle ground.\n- research: Run competitive intelligence research on any product category or idea.\n- validate-only: Market and business model validation for a Scout-approved idea. Takes ~1 week.\n- shape-only: 2-day kill test for a raw SaaS idea. Fast validation before investing time.\n- saas-cycle: Full SaaS idea-to-verdict pipeline. Takes an idea from raw concept through build, launch, and mea...","skillCount":16,"isInitial":true},"type":"attachment","uuid":"7b3c31eb-e2f7-473d-8df5-3de7b157bf14","timestamp":"2026-04-11T16:46:34.119Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Boldteq App/Boldteq","sessionId":"bbc8708a-a21f-4c19-91ad-343e51ec4ddb","version":"2.1.101","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"vast-popping-salamander"}
